{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 94,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O Jehovah, thou God to whom vengeance belongeth,\nThou God to whom vengeance belongeth, shine forth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lift up thyself, thou judge of the earth:\nRender to the proud ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " desert.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah, how long shall the wicked,\nHow long shall the wicked triumph?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They prate, they speak arrogantly:\nAll the workers of iniquity boast themselves.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They break in pieces thy people, O Jehovah,\nAnd afflict thy heritage.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They slay the widow and the sojourner,\nAnd murder the fatherless.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they say, Jehovah will not see,\nNeither will the God of Jacob consider.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Consider, ye brutish among the people;\nAnd ye fools, when will ye be wise?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that planted the ear, shall he not hear?\nHe that formed the eye, shall he not see?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that chastiseth the nations, shall not he correct,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that teacheth man knowledge?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah knoweth the thoughts of man,That they are vanity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed is the man whom thou chastenest, O Jehovah,\nAnd teachest out of thy law;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That thou mayest give him rest from the days of adversity,\nUntil the pit be digged for the wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For Jehovah will not cast off his people,\nNeither will he forsake his inheritance.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For judgment shall return unto righteousness;\nAnd all the upright in heart shall follow it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who will rise up for me against the evil-doers?\nWho will stand up for me against the workers of iniquity?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Unless Jehovah had been my help,\nMy soul had soon dwelt in silence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When I said, My foot slippeth;\nThy lovingkindness, O Jehovah, held me up.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the multitude of my thoughts within me Thy comforts delight my soul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Shall the throne of wickedness have fellowship with thee,\nWhich frameth mischief by statute?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They gather themselves together against the soul of the righteous,\nAnd condemn the innocent blood.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But Jehovah hath been my high tower,\nAnd my God the rock of my refuge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.94.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he hath brought upon them their own iniquity,\nAnd will cut them off in their own wickedness;\nJehovah our God will cut them off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Jehovah implored to avenge his people.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
